-# Static Kosmos backdrop for Rails-served pages. Ambient parity with the
-# SPA-side canvas <KronkKosmos>, minus the real Mates-orb geometry — a
-# pure-CSS layer with a void base, purple horizon glow, and a tiled
-# starfield. The React component computes actual chord geometry and
-# breathes over a 10-min cycle; this static version reads as the same
-# threshold-of-perception darkness so a member arriving from /me
-# doesn't step off the starry backdrop onto a flat one.
-#
-# Docs: docs/spaces/kronk.md § Open work.
-# Styles: app/javascript/styles/mastodon/_kronk_kosmos_static.scss

.kronk-kosmos-static{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
